A few notes on the choices here:

- **`avatarUrl?: string`** — the `?` marks the property as optional, so `avatarUrl` may be `undefined` or absent.
- **`id: string`** — if your IDs are numeric, change this to `number`. If they could be either (e.g., from different API versions), you could use `string | number`.

